{
  "binary": "kdlith",
  "description": "A handler-set slot projected into coalesced imports composes with reuse: the caller's copy-fields handler sets locale to en-gb, the first import reads it through the projection (its first stamp reads en-gb) before the imported document's own handler sets sv-se, the second import of the same source under the same projected context reuses the first invocation (no document item between the two import items, so the imported handler's sv-se never escaped into the caller), and after the caller's handler sets fr-fr a third import of the same source runs as a new invocation whose first stamp reads fr-fr; the caller's closing stamp reads fr-fr",
